-# 🏗 Scaffold-ETH 2
+# USDC Payouts
+
+Send USDC payouts to teammates and contributors on Base, with an on-chain record of every payment.
+
+- Contract: `Payouts` on Base (chain 8453) at `0x7c3f2A9d41B85E60Cf14a14e2b9D073A55e0b6F2`, pointed at Base USDC `0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913`.
+- Frontend page: `packages/nextjs/app/payouts/page.tsx`.
+- USDC lives in `packages/nextjs/contracts/externalContracts.ts`; `deployedContracts.ts` is regenerated by `yarn deploy` and must not be edited by hand.
+
+## Before deploying the frontend
+
+Set both variables (Vercel/system env, or `.env.local` locally). The fallbacks in `scaffold.config.ts` are shared
+Scaffold-ETH demo credentials, rate limited across every SE-2 project:
+
+- `NEXT_PUBLIC_ALCHEMY_API_KEY`
+- `NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLET_CONNECT_PROJECT_ID`
+
+> [!WARNING]
+> `packages/hardhat/deployments/base/` was never committed, so `deployedContracts.ts` is the only record of the Base
+> deployment. Running `yarn deploy` against a local chain rewrites that file from `deployments/` and would drop the
+> Base entry. Restore the Base deployment artifacts before running a deploy, or restore the file from git afterwards.
+
+## Scaffold-ETH 2
+
